/Dongxi_da_003.png/60px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.1</div><div style=\"width: 120px;\"><b>回合上限 / </b>20</div><div style=\"width: 130px;\"><b>战斗消耗 / </b><span class=\"item-link mode-xs\" data-itemid=\"2/4\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%86%E8%83%9E%E6%B4%BB%E6%80%A7\" title=\"细胞活性\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage img-hide\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%86%E8%83%9E%E6%B4%BB%E6%80%A7\" title=\"细胞活性\"><img alt=\"细胞活性\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8f/CurrencyIcon-204_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></a></span></span></span><span>&#8204;</span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">0</span></span></div><div style=\"width: 120px;\"><b>敌我人数 / </b>4&#160;: 4</div></div><hr /><div class=\"battle-scene\"><div class=\"battle-scene-bg\"><img alt=\"Img completed.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/25/Img_completed.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"404\" height=\"260\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"404\" data-file-height=\"260\" /></div><div class=\"battle-scene-chs\"><div class=\"battle-scene-battle\">BATTLE</div>坐席车厢</div><div class=\"battle-scene-en\">SEATING CARRIAGE</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">目标<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">GOAL</span></div><img alt=\"星\" src=