tle=\"卡戎\"><img alt=\"卡戎\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E6%88%8E\" title=\"卡戎\">卡戎</a></span></span>：<img alt=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/20px-Dongxi_da_003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" class=\"level-icon\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/30px-Dongxi_da_003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/40px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.60 | 2级塑造</div><div style=\"font-size:small; text-align:right\">装配<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1554\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%91%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%91%A2%E5%96%83\" title=\"向种子呢喃\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%91%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%91%A2%E5%96%83\" title=\"向种子呢喃\"><img alt=\"向种子呢喃\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Equipment_icon-1554.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1554.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Equipment_icon-1554.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1554.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Equipment_icon-1554.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1554.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%91%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%91%A2%E5%96%83\" title=\"向种子呢喃\">向种子呢喃</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>若记忆者灵感为<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[灵]</span>，攻击时处于<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[吟诵]</span>中，造成伤害提升<span class=\"color-value\">8%</span>；<br />回合结束时，若记忆者本回合为<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">涌动电场</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">回合开始时，涌动电场根据注入<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">电能</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">特殊</span> 科技的产物，用来使用精密器械（可以叠加，最多叠加<span class=\"color-value\">30</span>层，不可驱散）</span></span>层数升级：注入<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">电能</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">特殊</span> 科技的产物，用来使用精密器械（可以叠加，最多叠加<span class=\"color-value\">30</span>层，不可驱散）</span></span>值大于等于<span class=\"color-value\">50</span>时，术阵升级成<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">涌动电场lv2</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">己方角色术法威力<span class=\"color-value\">+25%</span>，创伤加成<span class=\"color-value\">+15%</span>，持续<span class=\"color-value\">3</span>回合</span></span>，注入<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">电能</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">特殊</span> 科技的产物，用来使用精密器械（可以叠加，最多叠加<span class=\"color-value\">30</span>层，不可驱散）</span></span>值大于等于<span class=\"color-value\">120</span>时，术阵升级成<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">涌动电场lv3</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">己方角色仪式威力<span class=\"color-value\">+35%</span>，术法威力<span class=\"color-value\">+25%</span>，创伤加成<span class=\"color-value\">+15%</span>，持续<span class=\"color-value\">2</span>回合</span></span>（当涌动电场消失时，注入的<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">电能</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">特殊</span> 科技的产物，用来使用精密器械（可以叠加，最多叠加<span class=\"color-value\">30</span>层，不可驱散）</span></span>值将一同清空）</span></span>至少注入过1次<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">电能</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">特殊</span> 科技的产物，用来使用精密器械（可以叠加，最多叠加<span class=\"color-value\">30</span>层，不可驱散）</span></span>，使己方全体暴击创伤提升<span class=\"color-value\">4%</span>，最多叠加3层</span></span></span></span></span>：Lv.60 | 5级增幅</div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3132\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%8A%E6%AD%BB%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"告死鸟\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%8A%E6%AD%BB%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"告死鸟\"><img alt=\"告死鸟\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-313201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-313201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%8A%E6%AD%BB%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"告死鸟\">告死鸟</a></span></span>：<img alt=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/20px-Dongxi_da_003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" class=\"level-icon\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/30px-Dongxi_da_003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/40px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.60 | 2级塑造</div><div style=\"font-size:small; text-align:right\">装配<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1557\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E8%8B%A6%E6%97%85\" title=\"生者的苦旅\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E8%8B%A6%E6%97%85\" title=\"生者的苦旅\"><img alt=\"生者的苦旅\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Equipment_icon-1557.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1557.png\" decoding=\"async\"